Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 07:18:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: raise DoubleBox Cam1 FILL and right-bias LED bg_loop
 zoom
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Move Cam1 MIXER FILL y from 0.1 to 0.072 (~30px @1080p) so the UVC
meets the db_loop right cutout top. Bump LED tema zoom to 120% with
right-edge pan (FILL -0.2 -0.1 1.2 1.2) for tema/SJV/ŠPORT/Počasie.
---
